<p>Infuse your two handed weapon with light while spinning around.</p><p>All creatures in radius one take <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">85%, 100%, 111%, 121%, 130%</acronym> weapon damage.</p><p>In addition while spinning your weapon shines so much it deals <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">83%, 105%, 122%, 137%, 150%</acronym> light weapon damage to all foes in radius 2.</p><p>At level 4 your spinning blade creates a shield that blocks all damage for 1 turn.</p>